    },
    {
      "text": "Site is three county-owned parcels: APNs 050-131-060, 050-131-070, 050-131-080.",
      "src": [
        "SRC-001254"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "County RFP: site approximately 26,500 sq ft; minimum 75 affordable units at or below 80% AMI with set-asides for extremely low income households and people experiencing homelessness, and preference for City and County employees. Ten developers submitted proposals; the selection committee unanimously recommended MidPen.",
      "src": [
        "SRC-003048",
        "SRC-003049"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "County Board resolution 25-1051 authorizes site control through a ground lease of at least 55 years and a Development Agreement with MidPen.",
      "src": [
        "SRC-003047"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "City page (updated 2026-10-15): SB 330 preliminary application, AB 130 CEQA exemption and State Density Bonus Law; proposed height 84'-5\" where MU-DC-100 zoning allows 50 feet; 80 parking spaces in a two-level partially below-grade garage; 8 short-term and 50 long-term bike spaces; first-round comments issued, awaiting resubmission.",
      "src": [
        "SRC-001254"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "BASE Landscape Architecture lists Walnut Street Affordable Housing in San Carlos for client MidPen Housing, 0.6 acres, architect FORA Architects.",
